{"unit_id":"inMessionante19__dsh-desktop-glass#card-zh","repo":"inMessionante19/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"e351f559813d1f3df9900186bed52557eb3ed38e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Glass 是面向 Windows 桌面版 DeepSeek Harness 的界面插件，为窗口提供原生毛玻璃或完全透明背景，同时让文字与控件保持清晰。它在设置的“通用”页面加入桌面背景控制，并通过原生桥接切换窗口材质。用户可选择玻璃或透明模式、调整毛玻璃遮罩、保存偏好、用快捷键开关并恢复原界面。适合希望在 Harness 窗口中看到动态壁纸或后方窗口的 Windows 用户。需要手动运行原生适配安装器并重新启动 Harness；无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:105-113","lib/client.js:141-143","native/desktop-patch.mjs:25-36"]}
{"unit_id":"inMessionante19__dsh-desktop-glass#card-en","repo":"inMessionante19/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"e351f559813d1f3df9900186bed52557eb3ed38e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Desktop Glass adds native frosted or transparent backgrounds to Windows DeepSeek Harness while keeping controls clear. Users can choose a mode, adjust tint, toggle the effect, and restore the original look from General settings. Manual setup and a restart are required; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:105-113","lib/client.js:141-143","native/desktop-patch.mjs:25-36"]}
