{"unit_id":"inMessionante19__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-1","repo":"inMessionante19/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"e351f559813d1f3df9900186bed52557eb3ed38e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Glass 的功能「双背景模式」：在设置中选择原生毛玻璃或完全透明，切换后立即更新桌面窗口背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:107-110","native/desktop-patch.mjs:12-20"]}
{"unit_id":"inMessionante19__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-2","repo":"inMessionante19/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"e351f559813d1f3df9900186bed52557eb3ed38e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Glass 的功能「遮罩调节」：仅在毛玻璃模式显示滑块，可将附加遮罩设为 0–60%，默认值为 8%。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:6-7","lib/client.js:109-110"]}
{"unit_id":"inMessionante19__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-3","repo":"inMessionante19/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"e351f559813d1f3df9900186bed52557eb3ed38e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Glass 的功能「快捷开关与恢复」：按 Ctrl + Alt + G 切换当前效果；也可在通用设置中恢复原界面或重置默认效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:112-113","lib/client.js:121-123"]}
{"unit_id":"inMessionante19__dsh-desktop-glass#feature-4","repo":"inMessionante19/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"e351f559813d1f3df9900186bed52557eb3ed38e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Glass 的功能「记住显示偏好」：用户切换模式、启停效果或调整遮罩时，设置会写入本地存储并在之后读取恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:7-15","lib/client.js:96-103"]}
{"unit_id":"inMessionante19__dsh-desktop-glass#caveat-1","repo":"inMessionante19/dsh-desktop-glass","commit":"e351f559813d1f3df9900186bed52557eb3ed38e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Glass 使用前须知：仅支持 Windows 桌面版，需手动运行原生适配安装器并重启 Harness；界面插件单独安装不会启用窗口背景效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["native/install.mjs:23-27","lib/client.js:80-83"]}
